# Project Structure Guidelines

## Core Project Components
- Define a clear folder structure for agent projects:
  - `src/`: Source code
  - `examples/`: Example usage
  - `tests/`: Test cases
  - `docs/`: Documentation
  - `tools/`: Utility scripts and tools
- Provide boilerplate templates for common agent patterns.
- Include configuration templates for different deployment scenarios.

## Component Organization
- Organize agent code into logical modules:
  - Input processors
  - Planning and reasoning components
  - Tool connectors
  - Memory systems
  - Output formatters
- Maintain clear separation between core agent logic and application-specific code.
- Define clear interfaces between components.

## Documentation Standards
- Each module should include:
  - Purpose and core functionality
  - Input/output contracts
  - Dependencies
  - Usage examples
- Maintain up-to-date architecture diagrams.
- Document design decisions and rationales.
- Include troubleshooting guides for common issues.

## Testing Approach
- Unit tests for individual components.
- Integration tests for component interactions.
- End-to-end tests for complete agent workflows.
- Test fixtures for simulating different scenarios.
- Performance benchmarks for critical operations.

## Recommended Project Setup
- Dependency management best practices.
- Development environment configuration.
- Linting and code formatting standards.
- Continuous integration workflow recommendations.
- Versioning and release management approach.

## AI代理特有的目录结构
- `prompts/`: 提示模板和提示工程资源
  - `templates/`: 可重用提示模板
  - `chains/`: 提示链模式和组合
  - `examples/`: 少样本学习示例
- `models/`: 模型管理和配置
  - `configs/`: 模型配置文件
  - `adapters/`: 模型适配器和接口
  - `evaluations/`: 模型评估结果
- `agents/`: 代理定义和实现
  - `roles/`: 不同角色的代理实现
  - `behaviors/`: 代理行为定义
  - `workflows/`: 多代理工作流
- `tools/`: 代理可以使用的工具
  - `connectors/`: 外部系统连接器
  - `actions/`: 代理可执行操作
  - `skills/`: 代理技能库

## 提示模板和配置组织
- 使用模块化提示结构，支持模板继承和组合
- 将提示模板与代码分离，便于非开发人员编辑
- 实施提示版本控制和变更历史
- 设计基于角色的提示库，适应不同场景
- 维护提示变体，用于A/B测试和性能比较
- 建立提示模板文档和使用指南
- 实现提示参数化和配置驱动的生成
- 分类管理特定领域的提示集合

## 模型权重和工件管理
- 定义模型版本命名和存储约定
- 实现模型权重的版本控制和变更追踪
- 设计模型缓存和优化策略
- 建立模型评估基准和比较机制
- 维护模型兼容性矩阵和依赖关系
- 实施模型回滚和版本切换机制
- 建立模型使用审计和监控系统
- 管理微调和适配器作为单独的工件 